# Oko, Shadowmoor Scion: "-6: Choose a creature type. You get an emblem with 'Creatures you control of the chosen type get
# +3/+3 and have vigilance and hexproof.'" Loyalty: 3, +2 (turn 1) = 5, +2 (turn 3) = 7, the {G} paid at turn 5's first main
# phase turns it over, and -6 leaves 1. Elf is chosen as the ability resolves. Llanowar Elves (an Elf) is 4/4 with vigilance
# and hexproof, and so is Bot1's Ornithopter, which Oko's +2 of turn 3 made every creature type (CR 205.3d); an Avian Changeling cast after
# the emblem exists is 5/5 at once, the emblem applying continuously (CR 113.6, 611.3a). Bot2's own Llanowar Elves, an Elf of
# another player, is untouched at 1/1.

